[{"code":"list_still_used","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":27,"col":22},"end":{"line":27,"col":30}},"title":"LIST CHANGED WHILE STILL IN USE","message":"`Response` changes a list it is handed in place, but Cmd.task sends what it\nreturns, and it returns what Cmd.task hands it, which may be a list the sender\nstill holds.\n\n27|            ( model, Cmd.task (λ⊤ → page.errors) Response )\n                        ^^^^^^^^ the list is changed in place here\n\nCopy the list with `List.copy` before it is changed, so the change cannot reach\nanything else that holds it.\n\nThis is sharing the checker can see: Cmd.task sends what it returns, and it\nreturns what Cmd.task hands it, which may be a list the sender still holds."}]
